nd drop the claimed trigger.\r\n- [x] No bulky artifacts, tensors, secrets, or local paths; each file <64 KB and the PR <256 KB under graph/.\r\n- [x] `uv run python -m bonsai_interp.graph.validate` passes.\r\n- [x] `uv run python -m bonsai_interp.graph.check_prereg --base origin/main` passes.\r\n\r\n## Sweep\r\n\r\n| Pole | Label | Outcome | AUROC | Median fire | Near misses >=0.30 |\r\n|---|---|---|---:|---:|---:|\r\n| `bonsai1/L23/N8373-` | Symbolic chemical equations | held | 1.000 | 0.281 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L30/N807+` | Place value instruction | held | 0.984 | 0.425 | 1/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L35/N4245-` | Modified jargon | held | 1.000 | 0.415 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L11/N5325+` | Abbreviated journal citations | failed | 0.492 | 0.030 | 2/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L3/N6590+` | French sol sel lit | held | 1.000 | 0.788 | 1/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L7/N4031-` | Office hours | failed | 0.719 | 0.251 | 1/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L29/N5291+` | Ethene formula C2H4 | failed | 0.891 | 0.619 | 2/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L0/N5252+` | Something like | held | 1.000 | 0.710 | 1/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L5/N2928-` | Sator name fragment | held | 1.000 | 0.817 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L8/N2083+` | Institutional name continuations | held | 0.953 | 0.460 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L12/N11513+` | Unrestricted any | failed | 0.523 | 0.025 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L8/N7609-` | Prose full stops | failed | 0.773 | 0.067 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L1/N9203-` | Plural nouns before of | failed | 0.883 | 0.129 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L18/N11331-` | Dense; personal initials | dense (test failed) | 0.531 | 0.098 | 0/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L27/N10060-` | Nanoscale material structures | failed | 0.688 | 0.342 | 3/8 |\r\n| `bonsai1/L33/N10362+` | Papal legate context | failed | 0.922 | 0.554 | 4/8 |\r\n","exit_code":0,"status":"completed"}}
